<section>
<h2>What the dataset demonstrates</h2>
<ul class="list">
<li>Ability to structure prospect research at meaningful volume.</li>
<li>Company, contact, role, email and LinkedIn fields can be organized into a repeatable research workflow.</li>
<li>Large datasets still require deduplication and evidence checks before being described as qualified or verified.</li>
<li>The public website does not expose the underlying raw dataset.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section>
<h2>How this connects to the paid pilot</h2>
<p class="lead">The recommended commercial starting point is deliberately smaller: 3–5 accounts researched deeply enough to validate fit, buying roles, signals and contact intelligence before scaling the workflow.</p>
